{"_v":1,"id":"stereophonic-off-broadway-2023","cat":"off-broadway","cs":79,"rc":8,"bd":{"positive":7,"mixed":0,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Jesse Green","o":"The New York Times","s":88,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2023/10/29/theater/stereophonic-review-david-adjmi-will-butler.html","d":"2023-10-29","q":"The music justifies the long buildup, and the play, Adjmi’s best so far, is as rich and lustrous as they come."},{"cn":"Jackson McHenry","o":"Vulture","s":86,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.vulture.com/2023/10/theater-review-stereophonic-goes-its-own-way.html","d":"2023-10-29","q":"Stereophonic is, refreshingly, the real thing."},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":47,"b":"Negative","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/stereophonic-review-fictionalizing-fleetwood-mac-playwrights-horizons-david-adjmi-4b5c77e3","d":"2023-11-09","q":"Audiences indifferent to Fleetwood Mac's fairly well-known history may merely be bored by the play"},{"cn":"Tim Teeman","o":"The Daily Beast","s":86,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.thedailybeast.com/review-stereophonic-makes-some-very-sweet-music-indeed","d":"2023-10-30","q":"Stereophonic is a must-experience, rather than simply a must-see."},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":85,"b":"Rave","t":2,"u":"https://www.talkinbroadway.com/page/regional/seattle/se771.html","d":"2024-10-16","q":"Stereophonic is a theatrical experience unlike any other, a three-hour journey that immerses you so completely in the world of a 1970s recording studio that you forget you're watching a play."},{"cn":"David Gordon","o":"TheaterMania","s":79,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.theatermania.com/news/review-a-fleetwood-mac-style-band-records-its-musical-masterpiece-in-david-adjmi-epic-stereophonic_1719164/","d":"2023-10-29","q":"Beautiful and unwieldy, mesmerizing and frustrating, it’s way too long for its own good, but I savored every moment."},{"cn":"Cameron Hughes","o":"Front Row Center","s":89,"